=== STEP 6: RootLayout Source Verification ===
File: mobile/src/app/_layout.tsx (lines 7-67)

Stack.Screen declarations (lines 37-63):
  <Stack.Screen name="chat" options={{title: "Chat", headerShown: false}} />
